  <AltText>
    Sprite of Kohaku_Dragon's OC, Nova. She has light purple eyes, orange hair, and is wearing a dark purple and blue dress with a blue sash. She is also wearing bright teal socks, and blue shoes with purple soles. The background has a big golden star.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    The wheel of fate chose Nova, and so I made a sprite of her.
    This was quite fun to make ^w^
